SUMMARY:It's a Vibe
DESCRIPTION:It's a Vibe is a relaxing young adult hangout where you can 
 color\, sketch\, do puzzles/board games\, or bring your own 
 knitting/crochet projects to work on while listening to music or hanging 
 with friends. Join us from 1-3 on Sundays to relax and destress before the 
 busy week.
